    <briefdescription>
<para>Main menu scene with visual text rendering. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classMenuScene" kindref="compound">MenuScene</ref> provides a graphical menu with options rendered using SDL_ttf. Navigation is done with arrow keys / D-pad, mouse clicks, and selection with Enter / Space / A button.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This scene requires a font file to be present in assets. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classFont" kindref="compound">Font</ref>, <ref refid="classSceneManager" kindref="compound">SceneManager</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
